---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";

const title = "Disclaimer";
const description =
  "Full disclaimer: this site is educational, publishes computed indicator " +
  "values, and does not provide personalised investment advice.";
---

<Base title={title} description={description} crumb="Reference / Disclaimer">
  <h1>Disclaimer</h1>
  <p class="lede">Last updated: 24 September 2026</p>

  <h2>Educational purpose</h2>
  <p class="lede">
    Everything on this site is published for educational and informational
    purposes. It computes and displays values of standard technical indicators
    from publicly available market data, and lets you filter securities using
    conditions you select. It explains how those concepts work.
  </p>

  <h2>Not investment advice</h2>
  <p>
    Nothing on this site constitutes personalised investment advice or a
    recommendation to buy, sell or hold any security. No content here takes
    account of your financial situation, objectives, horizon or risk tolerance,
    because the site has no knowledge of them.
  </p>
  <p class="lede">
    The operator of this site is an AMFI-registered mutual fund distributor
    (ARN-346031) and is <strong>not</strong> a SEBI-registered Investment Adviser
    or Research Analyst. For personalised advice, please consult a
    SEBI-registered investment adviser.
  </p>

  <h2>About the data</h2>
  <div class="defs">
    <div class="def">
      <div class="h"><code>computed_not_curated</code><span class="meta">how to read it</span></div>
      <p>Indicator values are the output of standard published formulas applied
        to price data. A stock appearing in a filtered list means only that its
        values satisfied the thresholds you chose.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="def">
      <div class="h"><code>describes_the_past</code><span class="meta">limitation</span></div>
      <p>Technical indicators are functions of past prices. They describe what has
        already happened. No indicator on this site predicts future prices, and
        none should be read as doing so.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="def">
      <div class="h"><code>errors_possible</code><span class="meta">no warranty</span></div>
      <p>Data may be delayed, incomplete or wrong. Corporate actions, splits and
        source errors all occur. Values are provided without warranty of accuracy
        or fitness for any purpose. Verify anything before acting on it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="def">
      <div class="h"><code>past_performance</code><span class="meta">standard but true</span></div>
      <p>Historical and backtested results do not guarantee future performance.
        Backtests are especially prone to overstating results — a subject the
        site covers directly rather than glossing over.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>Your responsibility</h2>
  <p class="lede">
    Investing and trading in securities carries risk, including loss of capital.
    Any decision you make is yours. Conduct your own research, consider your own
    circumstances, and seek professional advice where appropriate. The operator
    of this site accepts no liability for any loss arising from use of it.
  </p>

  <h2>Third-party links</h2>
  <p class="lede">
    Links to external sites are provided for convenience. This site is not
    responsible for their content or practices.
  </p>
</Base>
